// Canonical projection, in-place preparation, then the same projection over
// grouped blocks. Every consumer sees the same bytes, with no second weight
// image. Distinct finite headers/codes cover both packet and channel boundaries.

kernel.decl @qwen38_prepare_q5k_channel8(%outputs: index) launch(%weight: buffer)
